      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-11T11:57:25.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹23.38 (vs ₹11.11 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹23.38 (up from ₹11.11 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.08b (up 41% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹514.0m (up 111% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 13% (up from 8.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 10% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Machinery industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 9% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "dd2aadda-f2f3-414a-a7aa-bd3d4439c068",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-09T20:08:24.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹40.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹40.00. Ex-date: 15th May 2026 Payment date: 1st January 1970 Dividend yield will be 1.3%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.6%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (85% earnings payout ratio) but not covered by cash flows (170% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 35% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 69% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
