      "title": "High number of new directors",
      "body": "There are 5 new directors who have joined the board in the last 3 years. Non-Executive Non-Independent Director Faisal Hamadi was the last director to join the board, commencing their role in 2025. The company’s lack of board continuity is considered a risk according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model.",
